    "WordPress投稿データ整形": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "WordPressに下書き投稿", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "tags": [
    { "name": "YouTube" },
    { "name": "AI情報収集" }
  ],
  "notes": "必要な認証情報:\n1. YouTube Data API v3 Key (httpQueryAuth): key=YOUR_YOUTUBE_API_KEY\n2. Claude API Key (httpHeaderAuth): x-api-key: YOUR_CLAUDE_API_KEY\n3. WordPress.com OAuth Token (httpHeaderAuth): Authorization: Bearer YOUR_WP_ACCESS_TOKEN\n\n対象チャンネル（コードノード内で変更可能）:\n- Anthropic公式\n- OpenAI公式\n- Google DeepMind公式\n- Marques Brownlee (AI解説)\n- Two Minute Papers\n\nYouTube API割り当て: 10,000 units/日（1チャンネル検索=100units = 最大100チャンネル/日）"
}
